<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-16540] Ducktests fail because of addition of SNAPSHOT system view</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-16540</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;With addition of the SNAPSHOT system view in &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; ducktests fail because of inability to distinguish beween two MBeans:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;org.apache:clsLdr=70dea4e,name=snapshot&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;org.apache:clsLdr=70dea4e,&lt;b&gt;group=views&lt;/b&gt;,name=snapshot&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;In particular the snapshot_test.SnapshotTest.snapshot_test fails&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/9422&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/9422&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
